[0.011, "o", "# Draft Verification Protocol — Novapump NP-200 (synthetic)\r\n\r\n> **DRAFT — requires engineer review. Not for execution.**\r\n\r\nOrigin tags: **NEW** = drafted for NP-200; **REUSED (L-nn)** = legacy step carried over verbatim, still traces cleanly; **RETIRED** steps are listed at the end with the reason.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Delivery\r\n\r\n| Step | Action | Expected Result | Traces To |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "|---|---|---|---|\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| TC-001 · NEW | Inspect the available delivery modes on the pump (Adult profile active) and select each in turn. | The pump supports exactly the four delivery modes: Basal, Bolus, Extended Bolus, and\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| TC-002 · REUSED (L-01) | Open Basal settings and enter a rate of 1.00 U/h | Pump accepts and displays 1.00 U/h | NP-REQ-002 |\r\n| TC-003 · REUSED (L-02) | Enter a basal rate of 5.00 U/h then try 5.05 U/h | 5.00 U/h accepted; 5.05 U/h rejected | NP-REQ-002 |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| TC-004 · REUSED (L-03) | Run programmed basal for 24 hours and measure delivered volume | Delivered volume within ±5% of programmed | NP-REQ-003 |\r\n| TC-005 · REUSED (L-05) | Select Bolus and confirm 2.00 U | Delivery starts within 2 seconds and 2.00 U is delivered | NP-REQ-004 |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "...\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "## Retired from legacy protocol (NP-100)\r\n\r\n| Legacy Step | Action | Why it was not reused |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| L-04 | Select Temp Basal mode and set 150% for 1 hour | Temp Basal mode no longer exists; current modes are Basal, Bolus, Extended Bolus, Suspend. |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| L-06 | Request a 21 U bolus | 20 U maximum bolus changed: Adult limit is now 25 U and Pediatric 15 U (10 U in NP-REQ-009); rejection must show \"Bolus exceeds limit\". |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| L-07 | Press Up Down and OK to reach the Settings menu | Up/Down/OK arrow keys no longer exist; buttons are Bolus, Suspend/Resume, Menu, Back. |\r\n| L-08 | Press the Quick Bolus button once | Quick Bolus button no longer exists. |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| L-09 | Hold the Power button for 3 seconds | Power button no longer exists; only four buttons (Bolus, Suspend/Resume, Menu, Back). |\r\n| L-12 | Select Priming mode and run a prime cycle | Priming mode no longer exists in the current requirements. |\r\n| L-13 | Select Square Wave and set 4 U over 2 hours | Square Wave bolus is replaced by Extended Bolus (30 min to 8 h); 4 U over 2 hours step names a nonexistent mode. |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| L-16 | Discharge battery to 25% | Low battery threshold changed from 25% to 20% or less; discharging to 25% no longer triggers the alarm. |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| L-17 | Press the OK button during an active alarm | OK button no longer exists; alarm is silenced with the Back button. |\r\n"]
